{"unit_id":"280832849__dsh-rewind-lite#caveat-2","repo":"280832849/dsh-rewind-lite","commit":"30ebf74815ce73e1e4b3dcaaa1680f32bca9c97b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rewind-lite 使用前须知：文件快照默认写入 DSH_HOME 下的 rewind-lite-snapshots；关闭 fileCheckpoint 后不会记录或还原文件。见 src/host.js:378-385。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/host.js:378-385"]}
{"unit_id":"280832849__dsh-rewind-lite#caveat-3","repo":"280832849/dsh-rewind-lite","commit":"30ebf74815ce73e1e4b3dcaaa1680f32bca9c97b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rewind-lite 使用前须知：文件还原仅处理会话工作目录内符合条件的普通文件，超出范围或非普通文件不会按常规路径还原。见 src/snapshot.js:221-239。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/snapshot.js:221-239"]}
